SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This license covers ONLY the original material authored for this project:

  * tools/           the analysis toolchain
  * mappings/        the deobfuscation knowledge base
  * docs/            the written analysis
  * patches/         the patch descriptions and patch tooling
  * scripts/         the build and verification scripts

It does NOT cover, and must not be read as covering:

  * Flux.jar, libsoter.dll, irc-1.3.jar or any other component of the analysed
    target (see NOTICE.md);
  * any Minecraft / Mojang code contained inside the target;
  * decompiled output produced from the target, which is a derivative work of
    the target and remains subject to the target author's rights;
  * the files under releases/, which are patched copies of the target and are
    provided only as a local analysis artefact.

See NOTICE.md for the full statement.
